{"reviews":[{"id":"B075ZQRMBZ-0","r":5.0,"t":"Never Leaving the Tub","x":"I took this picture because every other photo I saw had fancy baths that aren't directly again the wall like most house are.  This style works in a normal bath as well.  I am a fiend for baths.  I have a two year old and a very social husband so bathtime is pretty much my only alone time.  I love being warm and relaxed.  This bath pillow really adds to the experience.  I didn't realize I was missing out on anything.  When I saw this, I totally bought it on a whim.  I am anything but disappointed","h":35,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2019"},{"id":"B075ZQRMBZ-1","r":5.0,"t":"Great pillow, but....","x":"Love this pillow. Sticks nicely, does not shift. The only downside is that it does stain. So if you are a bath bomber like I am, then whatever color your bath bomb is, that is the color your pillow fibers will turn to. Other than that, it's comfortable and does the job!","h":27,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2018"},{"id":"B075ZQRMBZ-2","r":5.0,"t":"Best of all the bath pillows I've tried","x":"Comfortable, cleans well, has hook at top so you can pull it up if it slides. Still loving a couple months later with frequent use.","h":18,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2018"},{"id":"B075ZQRMBZ-3","r":5.0,"t":"Received as gift...","x":"I was given this pillow as a Christmas gift and loved it so much that I ended up buying it as a gift for a friend. It seems to give my spine so much support when I use it and I find I am more relaxed and so comfortable! I won't take a bath without it now. My hair does get wet at the bottom, but that doesn't bother me at all. Great pillow!!","h":16,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2019"},{"id":"B075ZQRMBZ-4","r":5.0,"t":"Comfortable!","x":"Very comfortable, strong suction cups. I rinse it with cold water and hang it in the shower to dry. I love it!","h":16,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2018"},{"id":"B075ZQRMBZ-5","r":1.0,"t":"Doesn\u2019t work, hard to clean.","x":"This thing is useless. I loved it the first few times I used it, I couldn\u2019t understand why people didn\u2019t like it. After using it awhile, I found out why: it\u2019s awful. Half of the time the suction cups won\u2019t stick and the pillow falls into the tub, the other half of the time they stick like gorilla glue and pull out of the pillow. I\u2019ve lost 2 suction cups so far. I could probably sew them back on but this pillow is so bad it\u2019s not worth it.  One warning: if you take bentonite clay detox baths like","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2019"},{"id":"B075ZQRMBZ-6","r":3.0,"t":"Ok for baths","x":"It's comfy...lower part is a little stiff, but does what it is designed for...","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2017"},{"id":"B075ZQRMBZ-7","r":5.0,"t":"Love it","x":"Bought for someone as a gift.  They love it.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2018"},{"id":"B075ZQRMBZ-8","r":1.0,"t":"Very comfortable, but fell apart after 1st week.","x":"While it is a very comfortable cushion, the suction cups are simply sewn into the mesh material.  To my surprise, the bottom two started being ripped out within the first week, two others above them are barely attached after 2 weeks. It seems that the lower suction cups while strongly attached to the tub, can not withstand the pull of the cushion wanting to float up. Therefore, the cups started ripping out of the simply sewn in threads.  Unfortunately, I don\u2019t see how they can improve this unles","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2019"},{"id":"B075ZQRMBZ-9","r":5.0,"t":"Like a cloud!","x":"WOW! This pillow is so comfortable, it almost makes me forget how uncomfortable my neck was before. Bath time is so much more relaxing with this thing! Only problem I've had is getting the suction cups to stay completely, but I'm sure once I break it in, they will start working better.","h":3,"v":0,"d":"Oct 2019"},{"id":"B075ZQRMBZ-10","r":5.0,"t":"Great comfort while taking baths","x":"Really awesome product! comes in a nice bag for easy storage and travel. Very comfortable and does not change shape or form when in contact with water. huge comfort boost from lying on a hard bath tub","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2018"},{"id":"B075ZQRMBZ-11","r":1.0,"t":"Very disappointed. Do not recommend","x":"After two months the suction cups pulled away from the bath pillow. Too late to make a return because it is past their one month guarantee. Very disappointed. Do not recommend.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"May 2018"},{"id":"B075ZQRMBZ-12","r":3.0,"t":"I like it but the suction cups come off of the ...","x":"I like it but the suction cups come off of the pillow quickly. 4 broke off within the first 2 weeks","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2018"},{"id":"B075ZQRMBZ-13","r":3.0,"t":"Not great","x":"The mesh becomes painful if you lean on it too long and leaves marks on the skin I'll go back to using a plain plastic one  It also smelled really badly after just a week or two. I washed with bleach and it's better now, but I'm afraid I'll have to keep doing this.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2019"},{"id":"B075ZQRMBZ-14","r":1.0,"t":"Returning!!!","x":"This pillow is the most uncomfortable  pillow I have ever used. It makes me get out of the tub fast! Returning and getting the previous pillow that I purchased for comfort....thought I would give this one a try.  Big mistake F rating from me","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2019"},{"id":"B075ZQRMBZ-15","r":5.0,"t":"very useful","x":"I like the bubble bath, however the bath tub is not suitable for me because the tub is too steep. This is really useful for me  and are soft. I can really enjoy my bath right now","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2018"},{"id":"B075ZQRMBZ-16","r":2.0,"t":"Not worth it. Not mildew resistant.","x":"This product is NOT mildew resistant as advertised. It really not that comfortable either. I\u2019ve been using it for 2 months now and 3 suction cups ripped off back, there is mildew growing on it. I hang it dry every time I am done with it - doesn\u2019t matter. That off white, pinkish color you see is the mildew - it comes bright white. I\u2019m throwing it out. I should have known better because any mesh is going to let bacteria in there. Save yourself the hassle, just buy a bath pillow that is not mesh ma","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2018"},{"id":"B075ZQRMBZ-17","r":5.0,"t":"Best bath pillow","x":"Everything about this pillow is perfection.  It is just the right size, the fabric is super comfy, and the suction works really well.  I have washed it in the washing machine many times and it still looks great.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2019"},{"id":"B075ZQRMBZ-18","r":2.0,"t":"Only worked twice before tearing","x":"The suction cups are to strong for the material, even trying to slide it out of the tub is difficult. The cups ripped off on second use.  The material also isn\u2019t very comfortable for bathtub use.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2019"},{"id":"B075ZQRMBZ-19","r":5.0,"t":"Easy to clean and use","x":"This has been amazing! My husband uses it every night and it\u2019s easy to wash. I threw it in the washing machine and it held up great! It doesn\u2019t slide on the tub.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"},{"id":"B075ZQRMBZ-20","r":5.0,"t":"Worth the price. Very plush!!","x":"Love this product. It washes in the laundry well; it\u2019s very cushiony and comfortable. Well worth the extra price if you enjoy lounging in the bath!!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2019"},{"id":"B075ZQRMBZ-21","r":5.0,"t":"Super Comfy","x":"A roomy quality bath pillow attractively packaged. This pillow accommodates both a petite woman or a body building partner.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2018"},{"id":"B075ZQRMBZ-22","r":5.0,"t":"love it","x":"I wash the pillow in my washing machine and it took off one of the suction cups. over all the pillow is really comfortable.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2019"},{"id":"B075ZQRMBZ-23","r":5.0,"t":"I love this product","x":"I love this product. Every bath pillow I had was always so cold this is soft warm and comfortable I would buy it again","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2018"},{"id":"B075ZQRMBZ-24","r":3.0,"t":"Rather weak construction.","x":"This is a very comfortable pillow.... but the suction cups pulled off the back within weeks.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2019"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Most reviewers find the pillow very comfortable and supportive, often calling it a major upgrade for bath relaxation.","cites":[2,3,4,5,7,9,10,11]},{"text":"A common complaint is that the suction cups fail\u2014either not sticking, or ripping away from the pillow within weeks.","cites":[6,9,10,12,13]},{"text":"Several reviewers note cleaning and durability issues, including staining, odors, and the pillow falling apart.","cites":[2,6,9,12,14]},{"text":"A few reviewers find the pillow uncomfortable or stiff, with some reporting skin marks or returning it.","cites":[7,14,15]},{"text":"Some reviewers mention it makes a good gift and comes with a storage bag for travel.","cites":[4,8,11]}]},"qa":[]}